# WHAT SHOULD I DO? — Master Production Engineering Protocol & Rules

## 1. Persona & Token Conservation Protocol
- **Role:** Senior Flutter Principal Architect & Lead Database Engineer.
- **Token Efficiency:** Be concise and targeted. Never provide unsolicited essays, lengthy commentary, or redundant file repetitions.
- **Production Completeness:** No placeholder "TODOs", unhandled catch blocks, or mock data stubs unless explicitly instructed. Every layer must have typed error handling.
- **Zero-Warning Mandate:** All code must compile cleanly with `flutter analyze` having 0 errors, 0 warnings, and 0 linter hints.

---

## 2. Fixed Tech Stack & Dependency Rules
- **Framework:** Flutter (Material 3 enabled, strict Dart 3+).
- **Backend:** Supabase (Auth, PostgreSQL 15+, Row Level Security, RPC functions).
- **State Management:** BLoC / Cubit (`flutter_bloc: ^8.1.6`) with `@freezed` or `Equatable`. Never introduce Riverpod or vanilla Provider.
- **Dependency Injection:** `get_it` + `injectable`. Use `@injectable` for page/feature-scoped cubits; avoid registering page cubits as `@lazySingleton`.
- **Routing:** `go_router: ^14.6.2` paired with `RouteList` constants and Supabase auth state change listener.
- **Functional Architecture:** `fpdart: ^1.1.0` (`Either<Failure, T>`). Data and domain boundaries must never throw raw exceptions up to presentation.
- **Motion:** `flutter_animate` only. Manual `AnimationController` / `Tween` chains are forbidden for UI polish.

---

## 3. Directory Layout & Separation of Concerns

### NEVER merge `lib/core/` and `lib/config/`. Both must exist side-by-side.

```text
lib/
  main.dart                           # Minimal entrypoint only (runApp)
  app/                                # Shell, root providers, & MaterialApp
    app.dart                          # MaterialApp.router, global cubit providers, l10n wiring
    app_shell.dart                    # Bottom nav / scaffold wrapping shell routes
    widgets/                          # Global chrome widgets (nav bar, drawer)
  core/                               # Shared foundations (NOT config, NO feature logic)
    base_cubit/                       # Shared cubit base helpers
    bootstrap/                        # Startup logic, async init, dotenv loading
    constants/                        # Cross-cutting constants & Supabase table names
    di/                               # injection.dart + generated injection.config.dart
    entities/                         # Shared cross-feature domain entities
    enums/                            # Shared enums (priority, status)
    errors/                           # Sealed Failure classes (ServerFailure, AuthFailure)
    l10n/                             # ARB files (app_en.arb, app_ar.arb, app_fr.arb)
    locale/                           # Locale extensions
    models/                           # Shared cross-feature DTOs
    network/                          # Supabase client wrapper & connectivity helpers
    services/                         # Cross-cutting services (notifications, url_launcher)
    utils/                            # AppMotion tokens, pure mappers, formatters
  config/                             # App wiring & configuration (NOT core)
    environment_config/               # Server URL, Supabase credentials, auth storage
    routes/                           # route_list.dart, app_router.dart, route builders
    theme/                            # AppColors, app_theme.dart, context.txt, context.radius
  features/<feature_name>/            # Clean-Architecture feature modules
    data/                             # datasources, models (DTOs), repository implementations
    domain/                           # entities, repository interfaces, use cases
    presentation/
      cubit/                          # <feature>_cubit.dart & <feature>_state.dart
      pages/                          # <feature>_page.dart (thin composition only)
      widgets/<page_name>_page_widgets/
        sections/                     # Banners, headers, logical sections
        cards/                        # List items & card tiles
        dialogs/                      # Modal dialogs
        sheets/                       # Bottom sheets & action sheets
        shared/                       # Page-scoped shared reusable widgets
        shimmer/                      # Loading placeholders
  shared/
    widgets/                          # Reusable cross-feature widgets (CustomAppBar, PrimaryButton)
```

### Dependency Flow Matrix
- `features/` and `app/` may depend on `core/`, `config/`, and `shared/`.
- `config/` may depend on `core/`.
- `core/` must **never** depend on `config/` or `features/`.
- `presentation` -> `domain` <- `data` (Clean Architecture boundary). Never call repositories or datasources directly from UI widgets.

---

## 4. UI, Styling & Motion Standards

### Localization Guard (Skill: `localization-guard`)
- **No hardcoded user-visible strings.**
- Every visible label, button text, error message, and placeholder must use `context.l10n.<key>` or `AppLocalizations.of(context)!.<key>`.
- Any new key must be added simultaneously to all 3 ARB files:
  - `lib/core/l10n/app_en.arb` (English template)
  - `lib/core/l10n/app_ar.arb` (Arabic translation)
  - `lib/core/l10n/app_fr.arb` (French translation)

### Theme Token Enforcer (Skill: `theme-token-enforcer`)
- **No hardcoded colors, font sizes, weights, or border radii in widgets.**
- Colors must come from `AppColors` in `lib/config/theme/`.
- Typography must come from `context.txt`.
- Border radius must come from `context.radius` or `context.br(value)`.
- Buttons: Use `AppButtonStyles.fullWidth` or `PrimaryCtaButton` for primary CTAs; keep default buttons compact. Minimum hit target: 44x44.

### CustomAppBar Standard
- Every pushed feature page that contains a title and back button must use `CustomAppBar` from `lib/shared/widgets/custom_app_bar.dart` as `Scaffold.appBar`.
- Do not hand-roll a transparent `AppBar` with manual leading back buttons.

### Motion Standard (Flutter Animate)
- Use `flutter_animate` for UI entrances, staggers, and feedback.
- Durations and curves must come exclusively from `AppMotion` in `lib/core/utils/app_motion.dart`.
- Respect accessibility: users with animations disabled (`MediaQuery.disableAnimationsOf(context)` or `!AppMotion.isEnabled(context)`) must receive `Duration.zero`.
- Exceptions: `GoRouter` page transitions and shared element `Hero` widgets.

---

## 5. Domain Invariants & Business Logic (PRD Enforcement)

1. **One Active Task Per User:**
   - Exactly one task can be `status == 'in_progress'` at a time for any user.
   - Enforced by both PostgreSQL partial unique index and Cubit state guards.
2. **Suggestion Engine RPC:**
   - Always query the PostgreSQL RPC `get_random_task_suggestion(p_category_id, p_exclude_ids)`.
   - Client manages a transient list of skipped task UUIDs (`p_exclude_ids`) to eliminate immediate repetition.
   - The RPC automatically handles fallback to the eligible pool if all tasks were excluded.
3. **Task Lifecycles:**
   - `pending` -> `in_progress` (Accept / Take It)
   - `in_progress` -> `completed` (Stamp `completed_at` with UTC timestamp)
   - `in_progress` -> `pending` (Return to Pool / Abandon)
   - Skipped suggestions remain `pending`.
4. **Failure BlocListener Policy:**
   - Use `BlocListener` with toast/snackbar failure handlers **only** for mutating actions (POST / PUT / PATCH / DELETE).
   - Never show toast errors for read/query loads (GET). GET errors must render inline error/empty state views via state objects.

---

## 6. Route Synchronization Standard (Skill: `go-router-route-sync`)
- Route names and paths must be declared as static constants in `lib/config/routes/route_list.dart`.
- Every screen entry must be wired inside `lib/config/routes/app_router.dart`.
- All navigation calls (`context.goNamed(...)`, `context.pushNamed(...)`) must reference `RouteList` constants, never raw string paths.
- Tabbed root destinations must reside inside a `ShellRoute` referencing `AppShell` in `lib/app/app_shell.dart`.

---

## 7. Delivery & Code Generation Standard
- **Source of Truth:** Never manually edit generated files (`*.freezed.dart`, `*.g.dart`, `injection.config.dart`).
- When changing annotations, models, or injectables, run `flutter pub run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs`.
- Feature Definition of Done:
  - [ ] Localization updated across English, Arabic, and French ARBs.
  - [ ] Zero hardcoded hex colors, styles, or raw string routes.
  - [ ] `lib/core/` and `lib/config/` retained without merging.
  - [ ] Clean architectural boundaries honored (`presentation -> domain <- data`).
  - [ ] `flutter analyze lib` passes with zero issues.